    "slug": "umrah-rituals-guide",
    "title": "Step-by-Step Guide to Umrah Rituals",
    "content": "A clear, step-by-step guide to performing Umrah correctly.\n\n## Step 1: Ihram\n- Purify yourself (ghusl)\n- Wear Ihram clothing\n- Make intention for Umrah\n- Recite Talbiyah\n\n## Step 2: Tawaf\n- Enter Masjid al-Haram\n- Start at the Black Stone\n- Circle Ka'bah 7 times counterclockwise\n- Recite prayers during Tawaf\n- Pray 2 rak'ahs near Maqam Ibrahim\n\n## Step 3: Sa'i\n- Walk between Safa and Marwah\n- 7 laps (Safa to Marwah = 1, Marwah to Safa = 2, etc.)\n- Recite prayers\n- Men: run between green markers\n\n## Step 4: Halq or Taqseer\n- Men: Shave head (Halq) or trim hair (Taqseer)\n- Women: Trim a fingertip's length of hair\n- Umrah is now complete!\n\nImportant: Follow your guide for detailed instructions and avoid common mistakes.",
