    "slug": "health-tips-pilgrimage",
    "title": "Health Tips for Hajj and Umrah",
    "content": "Stay healthy during your pilgrimage with these essential tips.\n\n## Before Travel\n- Get required vaccinations (meningitis, flu)\n- Medical check-up\n- Pack necessary medications\n- Get travel insurance\n\n## During Travel\n- Stay hydrated (drink plenty of water)\n- Avoid direct sun when possible\n- Use sunscreen\n- Wear comfortable shoes\n- Wash hands frequently\n\n## Common Issues\n- Heat exhaustion: Rest, hydrate, seek shade\n- Dehydration: Drink water regularly\n- Blisters: Use proper footwear, bandages\n- Respiratory infections: Use mask in crowds\n\n## Emergency\n- Carry emergency contact numbers\n- Know your blood type\n- Keep medications in original packaging\n- Inform your guide of any health issues",
